@startuml
!pragma teoz true
!include _style_product_seq.puml
title Dispatch one due task reminder
autonumber

control "Family bot reminder scheduler" as Bot
boundary "Internal reminders API" as API
control "Privacy resolver" as Privacy
database "FamTrack SQLite" as DB
database "Bot chat + delivery state" as State
actor "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram

activate Bot
Bot -> API: GET /api/internal/reminders/due\ninternal secret
activate API
API -> DB: read due unfinished tasks + settings + members
activate DB
DB --> API: reminder candidates
deactivate DB
API --> Bot: policy inputs (no client authority)
deactivate API
Bot -> Privacy: resolve candidate destinations
activate Privacy

alt task.visibleTo is non-empty
  Privacy -> Privacy: private-only recipients\nnever select group chat
else public task
  Privacy -> Privacy: apply task override or family mode
end
Privacy --> Bot: allowed private/group destinations
deactivate Privacy

loop each allowed destination
  Bot -> State: check delivery key(task, dueAt, chat)
  activate State
  alt already delivered
    State --> Bot: skip duplicate
  else first delivery
    State --> Bot: send allowed
    deactivate State
    Bot -> Telegram: sendMessage(chatId, reminder)
    activate Telegram
    alt Telegram accepted
      Telegram --> Bot: message id
    else transient Telegram error
      Telegram --> Bot: retryable error
    end
    deactivate Telegram
    alt Telegram accepted
      Bot -> State: persist delivered key
      activate State
      State --> Bot: saved
      deactivate State
    else transient Telegram error
      Bot -> State: persist attempt/error only
      activate State
      State --> Bot: retry remains possible
      deactivate State
    end
  end
end

note over Privacy,Telegram
Missing private/group registration is a measured skip.
It never widens privacy to another destination.
end note
deactivate Bot
@enduml
